 546:Source/core/url.c ****     /* Anchor-only: #section — note the Lua builds this WITHOUT portStr when
 547:Source/core/url.c ****      * port is 80/443 but the expression differs slightly; mirror Lua exactly:
 548:Source/core/url.c ****      * scheme://host[:port-if-not-80/443]path[?query]rel  */
